  "content": "<h1>Stefan的附魔書，作者：StefanJ2_</h1><p><strong>從<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbettervanillabuilding.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方網站</a>下載：</strong></p><h2>內容特色</h2><p>厭倦了所有附魔書都長得一模一樣嗎？別擔心！Stefan的附魔書將把你那些單調的老舊書本材質，變成容易辨識且趣味十足的設計！</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/851e651f2d70eee1e5019c7337645a624f83a412.jpeg\" alt=\"books\"></p><h3>在原版遊戲中使用</h3><p>在原版遊戲中使用此資源包時，需搭配<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/enchantedbookenabler-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">附魔書啟用資料包</a></p><h3>與模組搭配使用</h3><p>使用模組時，需搭配<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a>或<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcit-resewn%252fversions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Citresewn</a>才能使用此資源包</p><h2>獲取專屬Minecraft伺服器</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fshockbyte.com%252fpartner%252fstefanj2_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9360084db5b7016f32cdf6978d0ca72c50b5d351.png\" alt=\"Shockbyte\"></a></p><h2>社群媒體</h2><p>資源包相關：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://discord.gg/a6KDAEpy6N\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540bettervanillabuilding\" rel=\"nofollow\">TikTok</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://youtube.com/bettervanillabuilding\" rel=\"nofollow\">YouTube</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fbettervanillabuilding%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Instagram</a></li>\n</ul><p>StefanJ2_個人：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/stefanj2_\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitch</a></li>\n</ul>",
